SUMMARY:SATURN OIL & GAS INC — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: SATURN OIL & GAS INC\nRoadshow: https://evercall.co/oacc/28526\n\n
 Deal context:\nSaturn Oil & Gas Inc. is launching a dual-tranche high-yiel
 d offering consisting of a USD $560mm and CAD C$150mm (~US$108mm) senior u
 nsecured 5-year notes\, with initial price talk in the high 8%-9% range (U
 SD)\, featuring a non-call 2 structure with a first call at par plus 50% o
 f coupon declining ratably to par and a semiannual mandatory offer to repu
 rchase 2.5% of principal at 101% beginning December 31\, 2026. Proceeds wi
 ll be used to finance the cash portion of the Burgess Creek acquisition\, 
 refinance existing second lien notes\, reduce RBL Facility borrowings\, an
 d for general corporate purposes. A global investor call is scheduled for 
 Monday\, July 20\, 2026 at 11:30am EST with pricing expected on Tuesday's 
 business.
